# Requests for the VS Code REST Client or JetBrains HTTP Client.
@base = http://localhost:3000
@key = dev-api-key-change-me

### Create an entry
POST {{base}}/entries
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Yesterday I slept 6 hours, energy 8/10, sore throat and a cough. Felt okay." }

### List entries
GET {{base}}/entries?from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-30&page=1&pageSize=20
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### Trends
GET {{base}}/trends?from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-30
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### Ask a question
POST {{base}}/chat
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "When did I have a sore throat this month and how was my sleep?" }

### Readiness
GET {{base}}/ready
